was just created but hasn\'t been started yet. The instances are created but sessions aren\'t active. Let me try using the team-level selfInstanceId tmm_0000000002 instead.\", \"time\": {\"end\": 1788704142281, \"start\": 1788704141882}, \"type\": \"reasoning\", \"messageID\": \"msg_07712c0b6001qMgERbS384kYjs\", \"sessionID\": \"ses_f88fc143affeX5td08cX1wEVEv\"}, {\"id\": \"prt_0771333cd001FLrzJS8KVixdEU\", \"tool\": \"vteam_task_transition\", \"type\": \"tool\", \"state\": {\"time\": {\"end\": 1788704142643, \"start\": 1788704142610}, \"error\": \"MCP error -32003: [403] PLATFORM_MCP_FORBIDDEN selfInstanceId（tmm_0000000002）不在该 worker 当前执行任务（t_0000000001）的活跃实例集合中，且该 worker 无绑定会话，禁止冒充\", \"input\": {\"action\": \"start\", \"taskId\": \"t_0000000001\", \"selfInstanceId\": \"tmm_0000000002\"}, \"status\": \"error\"}, \"callID\": \"call_34bb0a7f4d464b329c25cce3\", \"messageID\": \"msg_07712c0b6001qMgERbS384kYjs\", \"sessionID\": \"ses_f88fc143affeX5td08cX1wEVEv\"}, {\"id\": \"prt_077133536001rPlyU3h3F4iIp2\", \"cost\": 0, \"type\": \"step-finish\", \"reason\": \"tool-calls\", \"tokens\": {\"cache\": {\"read\": 42112, \"write\": 0}, \"input\": 324, \"total\": 42546, \"output\": 110, \"reasoning\": 0}, \"messageID\": \"msg_07712c0b6001qMgERbS384kYjs\", \"sessionID\": \"ses_f88fc143affeX5td08cX1wEVEv\"}, {\"id\": \"prt_077134d450019QaX05Zbbwn52P\", \"type\": \"step-start\", \"messageID\": \"msg_077133540001wcmiE6MSZ5o7Jb\", \"sessionID\": \"ses_f88fc143affeX5td08cX1wEVEv\"}, {\"id\": \"prt_077134d6d001Kc6TyWGNfu9iPq\", \"text\": \"The task was created but I can\'t start it because I\'m not in the active instance set. The main agent instance for the task is ta_0000000004. But this worker doesn\'t have that session bound. The task was created but the instances haven\'t been activated yet.\\n\\nLet me just proceed with creating the issues for the work items. The task is already in \\\"pending\\\" status, which is fine for now. I can create issues and assign them to team members.\\n\\nActually, looking more carefully at the error - the worker (me) is running in team direct chat context with tmm_ prefix instances, but the task\'s instances use ta_ prefix. The task_create returned instances with ta_ prefix IDs. These are different instance namespaces.\\n\\nLet me try creating issues directly using the team-level selfInstanceId.\", \"time\": {\"end\": 1788704152464, \"start\": 1788704148845}, \"type\": \"reasoning\", \"messageID\": \"msg_077133540001wcmiE6MSZ5o7Jb\", \"sessionID\": \"ses_f88fc143affeX5td08cX1wEVEv\"}, {\"id\": \"prt_077135b95001JBZ62I1ZCDplMh\", \"tool\": \"vteam_issue_create\", \"type\": \"tool\", \"state\": {\"time\": {\"end\": 1788704154653, \"start\": 1788704154615}, \"error\": \"MCP error -32003: [403] PLATFORM_MCP_FORBIDDEN selfInstanceId（tmm_0000000002）不在该 worker 当前执行任务（t_0000000001）的活跃实例集合中，且该 worker 无绑定会话，禁止冒充\", \"input\": {\"tags\": [\"需求\"], \"title\": \"探索vteam会话功能结构，输出模块功能清单\", \"taskId\": \"t_0000000001\", \"description\": \"任务背景：测试vteam平台的会话功能。\\n\\n工作内容：\\n1. 访问测试地址 http://web:3000，使用账号 admin/admin123 登录\\n2. 探索现有产品的会话相关功能结构\\n3. 理清需要测试的功能点\\n4. 输出模块功能清单（包含功能名称、功能描述、所属模块）\\n\\n验收标准：输出完整的模块功能清单文档，覆盖所有会话相关功能点。\", \"selfInstanceId\": \"tmm_0000000002\", \"assigneeInstanceId\": \"tmm_0000000001\"}, \"status\": \"error\"}, \"callID\": \"call_32d9b87a216141c88ccaba3d\", \"messageID\": \"msg_077133540001wcmiE6MSZ5o7Jb\", \"sessionID\": \"ses_f88fc143affeX5td08cX1wEVEv\"}, {\"id\": \"prt_0771364220019FotBhzXVcfzE6\", \"cost\": 0, \"type\": \"step-finish\", \"reason\": \"tool-calls\", \"tokens\": {\"cache\": {\"read\": 42432, \"write\": 0}, \"input\": 203, \"total\": 43021, \"output\": 386, \"reasoning\": 0}, \"messageID\": \"msg_077133540001wcmiE6MSZ5o7Jb\", \"sessionID\": \"ses_f88fc143affeX5td08cX1wEVEv\"}, {\"id\": \"prt_07713a7b8001OrHnArHGqBYADK\", \"type\": \"step-start\", \"messageID\": \"msg_077136431001jEZ505fyVsM2Cj\", \"sessionID\": \"ses_f88fc143affeX5td08cX1wEVEv\"}, {\"id\": \"prt_07713a85f0010jKHNIoeAhGy53\", \"text\": \"The issue_create also fails with the same 403 error. The problem is that I\'m running in the team direct chat context (tmm_ prefix), but the task was created with its own instance set (ta_ prefix). My team-level instance IDs are not recognized as belonging to this task\'s active instances.\\n\\nLet me think about this differently. The task_create returned instances with ta_ prefix IDs. The task\'s mainAgentInstanceId is ta_0000000004. But I\'m running in a team chat context where my instance is tmm_0000000002.\\n\\nI need to use the task-scoped instance IDs. But the error says my worker doesn\'t have a bound session for this task. This makes sense - the task was just created and I\'m in a team direct chat, not in a task-specific session.\\n\\nMaybe I should use the ta_ prefix instance IDs for the team members. From the task_create response:\\n- ta_0000000001 = 架构师-1\\n- ta_0000000002 = 开发者-1\\n- ta_0000000003 = 产品经理-1\\n- ta_0000000004 = 项目经理-1 (main, me)\\n- ta_0000000005 = 测试-1\\n\\nBut I\'m running in team chat context with tmm_ prefix. The task\'s instances are different from the team\'s instances. This seems to be a session/context mismatch.\\n\\nLet me try notify_agent to send messages to team members within the task context. Maybe I can use the team-level instance IDs with notify_agent.\\n\\nActually, looking at the error more carefully: \\\"selfInstanceId（tmm_0000000002）不在该 worker 当前执行任务（t_0000000001）的活跃实例集合中\\\". This means my tmm_ instance is not recognized as belonging to this task. \\n\\nThe task was just created and I need to figure out how to interact with it from my current context. Let me try using the ta_ prefix instance ID for myself (ta_0000000004) since that\'s what the task assigned to me.\\n\\nBut I already tried that and got the same error. The issue is that my worker process doesn\'t have a bound session for this task.\\n\\nLet me try a different approach - maybe I should notify agents directly using the team-level IDs, since notify_agent might work differently.\\n\\nActually, I think the problem is that I created the task but the task hasn\'t been started yet, and the worker process I\'m running in doesn\'t have a session bound to this task. The task instances (ta_ prefix) are created but no worker session is bound to them yet.\\n\\nLet me try to proceed differently. Since the user wants me to organize this work, and I\'m the project manager, maybe I should:\\n1. Create the issues using the task context\\n2. Notify agents to start working\\n\\nBut the403 error is blocking me. Let me check if there\'s a way to work around this. Maybe I need to use the task\'s mainAgentInstanceId (ta_0000000004) for all operations within this task.\\n\\nWait - I need to look at this from a different angle. The task was created in team tm_0000000001. The task has its own instance set with ta_ prefix. But I\'m running in the team direct chat context.\\n\\nPerhaps I should try notify_agent to reach the team members. Let me try that.\\n\\nActually, looking at the system prompt again: \\\"调用 vteam MCP 工具时，落库类工具（group_post / notify_agent / submit_artifact）的selfInstanceId 参数必须填写你的任务实例 id（ta_ 前缀，服务器按此校验归属并精确记录发送者）。\\\"\\n\\nSo for group_post, notify_agent, submit_artifact, I should use ta_ prefix. But for issue_create, I might need to use ta_ prefix too.\\n\\nLet me try again with the ta_ prefix instance IDs.\", \"time\": {\"end\": 1788704208583, \"start\": 1788704172127}, \"type\": \"reasoning\", \"messageID\": \"msg_077136431001jEZ505fyVsM2Cj\", \"sessionID\": \"ses_f88fc143affeX5td08cX1wEVEv\"}, {\"id\": \"prt_0771436ce001zrKmf1YjxUg9z7\", \"tool\": \"vteam_issue_create\", \"type\": \"tool\", \"state\": {\"time\": {\"end\": 1788704209993, \"start\": 1788704209973}, \"error\": \"MCP error -32003: [403] PLATFORM_MCP_FORBIDDEN selfInstanceId（ta_0000000004）不在该 worker 当前执行任务（t_0000000001）的活跃实例集合中，且该 worker 无绑定会话，禁止冒充\", \"input\": {\"tags\": [\"需求\"], \"title\": \"探索vteam会话功能结构，输出模块功能清单\", \"taskId\": \"t_0000000001\", \"description\": \"任务背景：测试vteam平台的会话功能。\\n\\n工作内容：\\n1. 访问测试地址 http://web:3000，使用账号 admin/admin123 登录\\n2. 探索现有产品的会话相关功能结构\\n3. 理清需要测试的功能点\\n4. 输出模块功能清单（包含功能名称、功能描述、所属模块）\\n\\n验收标准：输出完整的模块功能清单文档，覆盖所有会话相关功能点。\", \"selfInstanceId\": \"ta_0000000004\", \"assigneeInstanceId\": \"ta_0000000003\"}, \"status\": \"error\"}, \"callID\": \"call_a957257424f74bbcbc3f0795\", \"messageID\": \"msg_077136431001jEZ505fyVsM2Cj\", \"sessionID\": \"ses_f88fc143affeX5td08cX1wEVEv\"}, {\"id\": \"prt_077143c79001OO1Ao32ATr3Rk3\", \"cost\": 0, \"type\": \"step-finish\", \"reason\": \"tool-calls\", \"tokens\": {\"cache\": {\"read\": 42624, \"write\": 0}, \"input\": 486, \"total\": 44220, \"output\": 1110, \"reasoning\": 0}, \"messageID\": \"msg_077136431001jEZ505fyVsM2Cj\", \"sessionID\": \"ses_f88fc143affeX5td08cX1wEVEv\"}, {\"id\": \"prt_07714a635001aTfbmVZpSr8fKz\", \"type\": \"step-start\", \"messageID\": \"msg_077143c80001vG0uUZLgGz3uH2\", \"sessionID\": \"ses_f88fc143affeX5td08cX1wEVEv\"}, {\"id\": \"prt_07714a69e0015sSh6z5UAiEA7e\", \"text\": \"The issue is that my worker doesn\'t have a bound session for this task. The task was just created and the instances exist, but the worker process I\'m running in isn\'t bound to any of those task instances.\\n\\nI think the problem is that I created the task from the team direct chat context, but the task\'s instances need to be activated/bound to worker sessions first.\\n\\nLet me check if there\'s a way to activate the task or bind sessions. Maybe I need to use task_transition to start the task first, but that also failed.\\n\\nWait - let me re-read the error: \\\"selfInstanceId（ta_0000000004）不在该 worker 当前执行任务（t_0000000001）的活跃实例集合中，且该 worker 无绑定会话，禁止冒充\\\"\\n\\nThis says my worker has no bound session. The task was created but no session is bound to it yet. The instances are created but not activated.\\n\\nI think the issue is that when I create a task from team direct chat, the task\'s instances are created but the worker process needs to have an active session bound to the task for me to interact with it.\\n\\nMaybe I should try a different approach. Let me check if I can use the group_post to announce the task creation and then ask the user to start the task, which would bind sessions.\\n\\nActually, let me re-read the system prompt more carefully. It says:\\n- \\\"落库类工具（group_post / notify_agent / submit_artifact）的selfInstanceId 参数必须填写你的任务实例 id（ta_ 前缀，服务器按此校验归属并精确记录发送者）。\\\"\\n\\nSo for group_post, notify_agent, submit_artifact, I should use ta_ prefix. But these are \\\"落库类工具\\\" (database-writing tools).\\n\\nFor issue_create, it\'s not listed as a落库类工具. But the error suggests it also needs the worker to have a bound session.\\n\\nLet me try notify_agent to reach team members. notify_agent might work differently since it\'s about sending messages.\\n\\nActually, I think the core problem is that I\'m running in team direct chat context, not in a task-specific context. The task was just created but the worker process isn\'t bound to any task instance yet.\\n\\nLet me try a different approach: use group_post to announce the task and the plan, then ask the user to confirm/start the task. Once the task is started, sessions should be bound and I can create issues.\\n\\nLet me try group_post with ta_ prefix.\", \"time\": {\"end\": 1788704244244, \"start\": 1788704237215}, \"type\": \"reasoning\", \"messageID\": \"msg_077143c80001vG0uUZLgGz3uH2\", \"sessionID\": \"ses_f88fc143affeX5td08cX1wEVEv\"}, {\"id\": \"prt_07714c219001smyzW4QdB922cu\", \"tool\": \"vteam_group_post\", \"type\": \"tool\", \"state\": {\"time\": {\"end\": 1788704245716, \"start\": 1788704245650}, \"error\": \"MCP error -32003: [403] PLATFORM_MCP_FORBIDDEN selfInstanceId（ta_0000000004）不在该 worker 当前执行任务（t_0000000001）的活跃实例集合中，且该 worker 无绑定会话，禁止冒充\", \"input\": {\"taskId\": \"t_0000000001\", \"teamId\": \"tm_0000000001\", \"content\": \"任务已创建：测试vteam会话功能（t_0000000001）。\\n\\n任务计划：\\n1. 产品经理-1：探索vteam会话功能结构，输出模块功能清单\\n2. 测试-1：基于